    <title>IAP - In Gear | Cyl 1 | Spare 1 (unused)</title>
    <description>Spare IAP fuel map slot 3 for cylinder 1.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: Computed every cycle by FUN_4536c/45320 but the result (RAM 0xFEF01012/0xFEF01042 array slot 3-6) is never read by any other code. Was "IAP - Mode A | Gear 3" in the DanCycles naming.

AXES: X axis: 30 points, 0.00 to 78.1 vacuum kPa; Y axis: 50 points, 800 to 16000 RPM.

