    <title>ETV Limit A | Spare (unreferenced)</title>
    <description>Throttle LIMIT map (cap) for none.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_7C570 looks this map up via gear-indexed pointer table 0x18FD0C; FUN_7C944 applies it as min(limit, normal target) when ETV control state 0xFEF02AF2 = 1 (set by FUN_7C8F4 from status flags in the traction/anti-lift area). This slot is not referenced by the table, so it is unused. 

AXES: X axis: 23 points, 0.00 to 118 deg (abs. accel angle); Y axis: 39 points, 800 to 16000 RPM.

VALUES (stock 5JCZSJ30): 0.00 to 122.40 throttle angle (deg).

TUNING NOTES: Lowering cells limits throttle opening while that control state is active. Exact trigger (likely anti-lift / wheelie or low-speed limiting) not yet confirmed.

CONFIDENCE: Use as a min() limit confirmed from code; trigger condition inferred. Was "ETV - 22".

REFERENCE: data @0x1A3FB4, X axis @0x1905BC, Y axis @0x1A3F64, descriptor @0x18F7DC, code FUN_7c50e.</description>
