    <title>Market Variant :: DTC P0444 (EVAP purge valve) monitor enable byte</title>
    <description>Monitor enable byte for P0444 (EVAP purge control valve circuit, DTC index 87). FUN_33B12: monitor runs only when this byte = 0x80. 10L1 (5JCZSJ10) = 0x00 (no EVAP canister, monitor off); 10L4 = 0x80. The on/off switch is also under "Diagnostics - Monitor Enables".

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 128 raw (raw 128 / 0x80).

REFERENCE: @0x154976.

DIFFERS FROM 5JCZSJ10 in this read: free-text "stock" remarks above describe 5JCZSJ10.</description>
