    <description>Factory preset for ride mode C, loaded by FUN_6D57A into the active-mode settings (PW -&gt; 0xFEF026D2, TC -&gt; 0xFEF026D4, field 3 -&gt; 0xFEF026D5, field 4 -&gt; 0xFEF026D6, LF -&gt; 0xFEF026D7, field 6 -&gt; 0xFEF026D8). Modes U1-U3 take these values from the rider settings in RAM instead. Stock A = 1,1,0,0,1,1,0; B = 2,5,0,0,5,1,0; C = 3,10,0,0,10,2,0. PW and TC/LF roles confirmed by which code reads them; fields 3/4/6/7 not yet traced.</description>
