  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9016" flags="0x0">
    <title>ETV Slot Select | Neutral | PW 1</title>
    <description>Throttle-map slot (0-5) used in Neutral when the active power mode is 1. Read by FUN_6F786 into RAM 0xFEF026D3, which indexes ETV table 0x1AD7A4 (slot 0 = PWR 1 maps, 1 = PWR 2, 2 = PWR 3, 3-5 = the unused "ETV - Slot 4-6" maps). Stock: 0,1,2,2 for every gear. (Gears 3-6 also have an alternate byte used when PW = 1.)</description>
