  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9801" flags="0x0">
    <title>Rev Limiter (in gear) | Fuel Cut ON</title>
    <description>Main in-gear rev limiter - fuel is cut when RPM reaches this value. State machine FUN_2C73E: with the gear sensor in a valid gear and clutch released (FUN_2C3F2) and option 0x154447 != 0x80, state 2 runs FUN_2C652. Engine speed = RAM 0xFEF0258C. Cut type: FUEL (all injectors, primary + secondary) via cut-request flag 0xFEF00A30 bit1 -&gt; per-cylinder fuel-cut mode 0xFEF011A8 = 1 (FUN_4BAAE / FUN_477B0). Ignition and throttle are not touched by this limiter. Keep ON above OFF (hysteresis). Raising this raises the redline cut; the Ignition-Cut Limiter (12,000) sits above it as a backstop, so raising past ~11,900 also needs that pair raised.

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 11200 RPM (raw 28672 / 0x7000).

REFERENCE: @0x1542C6.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="27" />
    <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x1542C6" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
    <units>RPM</units>
    <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
    <datatype>0</datatype>
    <unittype>0</unittype>
    <DALINK index="0" />
    <MATH equation="X/2.56">
      <VAR id="X" />
    </MATH>
  </XDFCONSTANT>
  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9802" flags="0x0">
    <title>Rev Limiter (in gear) | Fuel Cut OFF (resume)</title>
    <description>Fuel is restored when RPM falls below this value (FUN_2C652). Keep it ~100 rpm below the ON value. Engine speed = RAM 0xFEF0258C. Cut type: FUEL (all injectors, primary + secondary) via cut-request flag 0xFEF00A30 bit1 -&gt; per-cylinder fuel-cut mode 0xFEF011A8 = 1 (FUN_4BAAE / FUN_477B0). Ignition and throttle are not touched by this limiter.

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 11100 RPM (raw 28416 / 0x6F00).

REFERENCE: @0x1542C4.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="27" />
    <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x1542C4" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
    <units>RPM</units>
    <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
    <datatype>0</datatype>
    <unittype>0</unittype>
    <DALINK index="0" />
    <MATH equation="X/2.56">
      <VAR id="X" />
    </MATH>
  </XDFCONSTANT>
  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9803" flags="0x0">
    <title>Rev Limiter (neutral / clutch) | Fuel Cut ON</title>
    <description>Limiter used when not in a valid gear (neutral, or clutch pulled), state 3 after the debounce counter 0xFEF00A20 &gt;= 0x154448. Code: FUN_2C68C (and FUN_2C6C6, which uses the identical pair at 0x1542CC/CE). Engine speed = RAM 0xFEF0258C. Cut type: FUEL (all injectors, primary + secondary) via cut-request flag 0xFEF00A30 bit1 -&gt; per-cylinder fuel-cut mode 0xFEF011A8 = 1 (FUN_4BAAE / FUN_477B0). Ignition and throttle are not touched by this limiter.

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 10800 RPM (raw 27648 / 0x6C00).

REFERENCE: @0x1542CA.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="27" />
