  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9807" flags="0x0">
    <title>Ignition-Cut Limiter | ON</title>
    <description>Backstop limiter that is ALWAYS evaluated (FUN_2C700): sets 0xFEF00A19 bit2 -&gt; 0xFEF00A30 bit2 -&gt; ignition-cut mode 0xFEF01554 = 2 on all cylinders (FUN_4FBCC, coil outputs inhibited by FUN_50EE2). This is the only SPARK-cut limiter in the stock calibration.

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 12000 RPM (raw 30720 / 0x7800).

