    <title>Progressive Limiter | Stage 1 OFF (normal)</title>
    <description>4-stage progressive fuel-cut limiter (FUN_2C5B0, state 1 - only used if option 0x154447 = 0x80). Stage 1-3 = partial cut using the cylinder mask 0x1826D8 and skip-pattern bytes 0x1826D9-0x1826E1 (FUN_4B85E / FUN_4BC76); stage 4 = full cut. STOCK: all 25,593-25,600 rpm and option = 0x00, i.e. DISABLED - the bike uses the simple on/off limiter instead.

