  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9829" flags="0x0">
    <title>Progressive Limiter Enable</title>
    <description>Option byte read by FUN_2C4CC: 0x80 = in-gear limiting uses the 4-stage progressive limiter (state 1); anything else = simple on/off limiter (state 2). STOCK 0x00. Only switch to 0x80 after setting the progressive thresholds and a non-zero cut mask (0x1826D8).

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 0.00 raw (raw 0 / 0x0).

