  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x982A" flags="0x0">
    <title>Per-Gear Limiter Enable</title>
    <description>0x80 = per-gear limiter FUN_2C068 active (stock 0x80 - required for the 6th-gear speed governor). Set to 0x00 to disable all per-gear limits.

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 128 raw (raw 128 / 0x80).

