    <description>Launch-control RPM limiter, level 2, threshold 1 of 4. Code: FUN_28E5E copies the 4 words for the selected LC level (RAM 0xFEF026D9 = 1/2/3) into 0xFEF009DA-E0; FUN_2BD08 then runs a staged limiter while LC is active (0xFEF00702 bit5). Word 1-3 = soft zone: 0xFEF009C1 bit1 -&gt; per-cylinder pattern fuel cut (FUN_4B9DA -&gt; 0xFEF01309 -&gt; fuel-cut mode 3, skip pattern from 0x1826D9-0x1826E1). Word 4 = hard limit: 0xFEF009C1 bit0 -&gt; full fuel cut on all injectors. No spark cut and no timing retard is used by the LC RPM limiter; throttle is capped separately by the "Launch Control - Throttle Limit" maps. Keep the four values ascending. Stock spacing is ~25-75 rpm.

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 5923.05 RPM (raw 15163 / 0x3B3B).

