  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0xB001" flags="0x0">
    <title>Sensor :: IAP (manifold) Sensor GAIN</title>
    <description>IAP sensor gain. FUN_742E2: counts = 7862 + (OFFSET - 0x8000) + rawADC x GAIN x 32 / 21850 (21850 = code immediate at 0x74302), clamped 0..65535; internal scale 393.14 counts/kPa, 7862 = 0 kPa. For a replacement sensor with kPa = a x rawADC + b: GAIN = round(393.14 x a x 21850 / 32), OFFSET = round(32768 + 393.14 x b). With the stock code the internal IAP saturates at 65535 counts (~147 kPa) - a boost-capable sensor needs the divisor patch too. Stock 0x81AA (33194).

ADDRESS 0x18EF58.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="51" />
    <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x18EF58" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
    <units>raw</units>
    <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
    <datatype>0</datatype>
    <unittype>0</unittype>
    <DALINK index="0" />
    <MATH equation="X">
      <VAR id="X" />
    </MATH>
  </XDFCONSTANT>
