    <description>Per-cylinder primary-injector quantity-to-time scaler in FUN_460F6 (primary time = qty x split x this / 2^23). Stock 132. Proportional: lower = less fuel on cylinder 1. Use for per-cylinder balance or, alternatively to K, to rescale primaries only.

