    <title>Fuel Blend - WOT Throttle-Path Gate</title>
    <description>At/above this throttle angle (fef02604) the ECU forces 100% TPS-map fuel (w = 256) - FUN_4916E/FUN_491BC. Below it the IAP/TPS blend follows the threshold curve. Stock 33282 = 91.4 deg. Raise toward 0xFFFF to let the IAP maps keep authority at WOT (only sensible if the IAP maps are tuned for WOT).

