    <description>FUN_2C3F2: gear-position sensor voltage (fef025CE = raw ADC &lt;&lt; 6) inside any of the six [Low, High] windows = "valid gear position"; outside all of them (between gears / sensor fault) with option 0x18F0D3 = 0x80 the in-gear flag (FUN_2C3BC) is cleared. Window 4 = gear 4 (in order). Only change if you fit a different gear-position sensor or shift drum.

