  <XDFFLAG uniqueid="0x201B6">
    <title>Quickshifter :: Shift Actions | On-Throttle | Phase 1 | A Spark Cut</title>
    <description>Decoded from FUN_2A4D4-FUN_2BA00 (quickshifter module). Shift-action table (16 bytes per profile, 4 per phase, 0x80 = action ON). Shared by upshifts (row = upshift phase fef00A13, FUN_2ABA2/2AC4C) and downshifts (row = downshift phase fef00A14, FUN_2B204/2B2AE). On-Throttle: profile used when throttle is at/above the threshold map. Action A Spark Cut: sets fef009AE bit6 -&gt; fef00970 bit0 -&gt; ignition coil inhibit (FUN_4FBCC). Confidence: A, B HIGH; C, D MEDIUM.

