  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x201D6" flags="0x0">
    <title>SWITCH Quickshifter :: Live Profile Switching | Upshift</title>
    <description>Decoded from FUN_2A4D4-FUN_2BA00 (quickshifter module). FUN_2AA2A: normally the on-/off-throttle action profile for a upshift is chosen once, while the shift logic is idle, and then held for the whole shift. 0x80 = the profile follows the on-throttle flag (fef009AE bit2) continuously, so it can change mid-shift. Stock 0 (latched).

STOCK (5JCZSJ30): 0.00 raw (raw 0 / 0x0). ADDRESS 0x154474, 8-bit.</description>
